# Text-to-Speech (TTS)
# The application uses Puter.js (puter.ai.txt2speech) for multilingual studio-grade TTS.
# Puter.js operates directly in the browser and requires no API key.

# Gemini API Key (Required for AI Term Generation CLI & prompt engine)
# Obtain your free API key at: https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey
GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here
